<title>POLAND: Kredyt Bank takes over Budimex subsidiary.</title>
<headline>Kredyt Bank takes over Budimex subsidiary.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kredyt Bank said in a statement it paid Budimex SA construction firm 22.4 million zlotys for a 56 percent stake in the firm's trading subsidiary Budimex Trading Sp. z o.o.</p>
<p>The bank gave no further details and company officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>Budimex, which bought a 53-percent stake in Budimex Trading from the state treasury early this year, is one of Kredyt's largest shareholders with about eight percent of shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
